# ======================
# HDDS Demos - .gitignore
# ======================

# --- Rust build artifacts ---
**/target/

# --- Node.js ---
**/node_modules/

# --- Web build output ---
**/dist/

# --- ESP-IDF build artifacts ---
**/.embuild/
**/build/
hdds-remote-sensor/archives/

# --- Generated code ---
# The generated Rust is tracked, so a clone builds without a generator, and
# `make gen` refreshes it in place after an IDL change. The fourteen negations
# that used to live here exempted the hand-written wrappers from a rule that no
# longer exists.
**/*-viewer/src/types.ts
sentinel-home/sentinel-types/python/
sentinel-home/sentinel-types/typescript/

# --- Media (hosted on web, not in git) ---
# Anchored to the root on purpose: unanchored, these matched a directory of
# the same name at ANY depth and silently hid docs/screenshots/.
/videos/
/screenshots/
/images/
**/assets/raw/

# --- WIP / planning docs ---
DEMO_NEXT.md
WIP_ROS2.md
**/README2.md

# --- Not part of the pack, kept out on purpose ---
# These two trees sit next to the pack but are not published with it. Leaving
# them untracked is a decision, not an oversight: do not add them.
sentinel-home/
sentinel-demo/

# --- Binary artifacts ---
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
*.o
*.obj
*.glb
# Exception: the escort vehicle the convoy viewer loads, built by
# convoy-escort/tools/generate-vehicle-model.py
!convoy-escort/convoy-viewer/public/assets/models/escort-vehicle.glb

# --- Vendored third-party libs (auto-installed by PlatformIO via lib_deps) ---
**/lib/EloquentEsp32cam/

# --- Lock files (regenerable) ---
**/package-lock.json

# --- Editor / OS junk ---
*.bak
*.orig
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Logs and runtime data ---
*.log
*.pid
*.lp

# --- IDE ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
